{[%mdl 8256] C90: Closed Ruy Lopez with 7...d6: Early deviations} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nf3 Bb4+ 4. Bd2 a5 5. g3 d5 6. Qc2 Nc6 7. Bg2 dxc4 8. Qxc4 Qd5 9. Qxd5 exd5 10. O-O Bg4 11. Be3 a4 (11... Ne4) 12. Rc1 Ba5 (12... Bd6 13. Nc3 $19 (13. Nbd2 O-O 14. h3 Bxf3 15. Nxf3 $19) 13... Ra5 {is the last straw} 14. Bg5 a3 15. b3) 13. Ne5 Bxe2 (13... Nxe5 14. dxe5 $19 Nd7 $142 15. Bxd5 c6 16. Bg2 Nxe5 $19 (16... Bxe2 17. f4) 17. Bd4 $142 {it becomes clear that Black will call all the shots}) 14. Nxc6 bxc6 15. Rxc6 Ra6 (15... O-O 16. Nc3 Bc4 17. Rxc4 dxc4 18. Bxa8 $4 {the pressure is too much, White crumbles} Bxc3 19. bxc3 Rxa8 20. Rb1 Nd5 21. Bd2 c6 22. Rb7) (15... Kd7 16. Rc2 Bd3 17. Bh3+ {is one last hope} Ke7 18. Rc5) (15... Rb8 16. Rc5) 16. Rxa6 Bxa6 17. Nc3 a3 18. b4 Bxb4 {last book move} 19. Nxd5 {White threatens to win material: Bb3xd5} Nxd5 {Black has an active position} 20. Bxd5 {White threatens to win material: Ng5xf7} O-O 21. Rb1 {[%cal Rb3f7,Rg5f7,Rh5f7,Gd7f7,Gd8f7,Gg8f7] f7 becomes the focus of attention. White has a mate threat} Be7 {Black threatens to win material: h6xg5} 22. Rc1 (22. Rb3 Rd8 $2 23. Bf3 Bc4 $4 {a blunder in a bad position} 24. Rc3 Bxa2 25. Bc1 Bb4 26. Re3 Kf8 27. Bxa3 Rxd4) 22... Bd6 23. Rc3 $11 Rd8 24. Bf3 Rb8 25. Bc1 Kf8 26. Kg2 Rb1 27. Be4 (27. h4 {Menacing} Bb7 (27... Rb4 28. Rxa3 Rc4 29. Rxa6 Rxc1 30. Bd5) 28. Bxb7 $2 Rxb7 $17 29. Bxa3 Bxa3 $1 {Mate attack} 30. Rxa3) 27... Rb4 0-1

