 {?} Nxd2 28. Rxd2 dxc4+ $19) 27... Rxd5 28. Be3 (28. Bb4 {?} Rc2 29. Re2 Rxe2 30. Qxe2 Nc3 $19 {!}) 28... Rc3 (28... Rcd8 29. Rxd5 Rxd5 30. Rc1) 29. Rxd5 ({It was interesting try here} 29. g4) (29. b4 {!?}) 29... Qxd5 30. Rd1 Qe6 {MIKHALCHISHIN: 'Diagram '} 31. Rd8+ ({White would have not a single problem after} 31. b4 Kh7 32. Rd4 Nf6 33. h3) 31... Kh7 32. Rf8 ({Now it was necessary to try to sacrifice sa pawn for activization} 32. Qd1 Rxb3 33. Qd5 Qxd5 34. Rxd5 Kg6 35. Rd8) 32... Nf6 33. b4 Rb3 34. a5 bxa5 ({Possible was} 34... b5) 35. bxa5 Ra3 (35... Ng4 36. Qxf5+ Qxf5 37. Rxf5 Rxe3 38. h3 {=}) 36. Ra8 {MIKHALCHISHIN: '?' '?'} (36. Qa8 Nd5 (36... Rxa5 37. Bd4 {!?} (37. Rh8+ Kg6 38. Rd8 Ra2 39. Rd2 $17) 37... Ng8 (37... Nd7 38. Rh8+ Kg6 39. Rg8 Nf6 40. Bxf6 Qxf6 41. Rc8 $130) 38. Rc8 Qd5+ 39. Qxd5 Rxd5 40. Bc3 $15 {/}) 37. Bc1 Rxa5 38. Re8 Qf7 39. Bb2) (36. Qb7 {?} Nd5 37. Bc1 Qe4+ 38. Kg1 Rd3 $19) 36... Nd5 37. Rf8 {MIKHALCHISHIN: 'Diagram '} f4 $3 $19 {!} (37... Nxe3+ {!?} 38. fxe3 Rxa5) 38. Rxf4 (38. gxf4 Nxe3+ $19 39. fxe3 Ra2+ {?!} (39... Rxe3 40. Qd1 Qe4+ 41. Kf2 Rd3 42. Qe2 Qd4+ $19) 40. Kg3 (40. Kh1 {?} Qg6 $19) 40... Qg6+ 41. Kh3 Qc2 42. Qh1 (42. Qg3 {?} Qe2 $19) 42... Rxa5 $15 {/}) 38... Nxf4+ 39. Qxf4 Rxa5 40. h4 Qd5+ 0-1

