{[%mdl 8256] C84: Closed Ruy Lopez: Unusual White 6th moves} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. O-O Be7 6. d4 exd4 7. e5 Nd5 8. Nxd4 Nxd4 9. Qxd4 Nb6 10. Qg4 Nxa4 11. Qxg7 Rf8 12. Bh6 {last book move} d5 13. Qxh7 Bd7 14. Nd2 Bb5 15. c4 dxc4 (15... Bc6 $5 16. Rfe1 Nc5 $16) 16. Ne4 Nxb2 17. Bxf8 Bxf8 18. Nf6+ Ke7 19. Rfe1 Qd4 $2 (19... Qd3 $142 20. Ne4 Qa3 $16) 20. Re4 Qc5 (20... Qd2 {does not win a prize} 21. e6 Nd1 22. Qxf7+ Kd6 23. Ng4 $18) 21. e6 Kd6 22. e7 Kc6 23. Qxf7 Bxe7 (23... Kb6 {doesn't do any good} 24. Re6+ Ka7 25. Ne4 $18) 24. Rxe7 Kb6 25. Rxc7 $3 {Deflection: c7} Qd4 (25... Qxc7 26. Nd5+ {Deflection}) (25... Z0 $140 26. Rxc5 {Wins material}) 26. Rxb7+ Ka5 27. Qd5 (27. Nd5 $142 {nails it down} Rc8 28. Nc7 Nd1 $18) 27... Rd8 28. Qxd4 Rxd4 29. h3 c3 30. Rc1 Kb4 31. Re7 (31. Rc7 {might be the shorter path} Bc4 32. Rc2 Na4 $18) 31... Bc4 $2 (31... Nd3 32. Rc2 Nf4 $18) 32. Ne4 Rd1+ 33. Rxd1 Nxd1 34. Nxc3 (34. Rb7+ $142 $5 {keeps an even firmer grip} Bb5 35. Rc7 Bd3 36. a3+ Kb3 37. Nc5+ Kc2 $18) 34... Nxc3 35. h4 Bxa2 36. h5 a5 37. h6 Bb1 38. h7 (38. Rb7+ $5 {seems even better} Nb5 39. h7 Bxh7 40. Rxh7 a4 $18) 38... Bxh7 39. Rxh7 a4 40. g4 (40. Rb7+ $5 {and White can already relax} Nb5 41. Re7 a3 $18) 40... a3 41. Ra7 $4 {ruins a clearly superior position} (41. Rb7+ $142 {and White can already relax} Nb5 42. Re7 $18) 41... Na4 $4 {an unfortunate move that relinquishes the win} (41... a2 $142 {would be a reprieve} 42. Rxa2 Nxa2 $11) 42. Rb7+ $18 Kc3 43. Rb1 Kc2 (43... Nc5 {doesn't get the cat off the tree} 44. Rc1+ Kb4 45. g5 $18) 44. Re1 Nc3 45. g5 a2 (45... Kd2 {cannot change destiny} 46. Ra1 Kc2 47. Rxa3 $18) 46. g6 Nb1 (46... Ne4 {is no salvation} 47. g7 Nf6 48. f4 $18) 47. g7 a1=Q 48. g8=Q Kd2 49. Qe6 Qg7+ 50. Kf1 Nc3 51. Qe3+ Kc2 52. Rc1+ Kb3 53. Qxc3+ Qxc3 54. Rxc3+ Kxc3 55. Ke2 (55. Kg2 Kd4 56. Kf3 Ke5 57. Kg4 Kf6 58. Kf4 Kg6 59. Ke5 Kf7 60. Kf5 Kg7 61. Ke6 Kf8 62. f4 Kg7 63. f5 Kf8 64. Kf6 Ke8 65. Kg7 Kd7 66. f6 Kd6 67. f7 Ke5 68. f8=Q Ke4 69. Kf6 Kd4 70. Qd6+ Kc3 71. Ke5 Kc4 72. Qd2 Kb5 73. Qd5+ Kb6 74. Kd6 Ka7 75. Kc6 Ka8 76. Kb6+ Kb8 77. Qb7#) 55... Kd4 56. Kf3 Ke5 57. Kg4 Kf6 58. Kf4 (58. Kf4 Ke6 59. Kg5 Kf7 60. Kf5 Kg7 61. Ke6 Kf8 62. f3 Kg8 63. f4 Kg7 64. f5 Kf8 65. Kf6 Ke8 66. Kg7 Ke7 67. f6+ Kd6 68. f7 Kc5 69. f8=Q+ Kd4 70. Qc8 Kd3 71. Kg6 Kd4 72. Qc2 Kd5 73. Qc3 Ke4 74. Kf6 Kd5 75. Qb4 Kc6 76. Ke6 Kc7 77. Qb5 Kc8 78. Kd6 Kd8 79. Qd7#) 1-0

