1. d4 c6 2. c4 Nf6 3. Nc3 d5 4. Nf3 g6 5. cxd5 cxd5 6. Bf4 Nc6 7. e3 Bg7 8. Be2 (8. h3 {transposes to the main line.}) 8... O-O (8... Nh5 {may transpose to the game.}) 9. O-O (9. h3) 9... Nh5 $1 {The omission of h2-h3 offers Black two main ideas, ...g4 and ...h5. Chasing the bishop is the more effective of them.} (9... Bg4 10. Qb3 Na5 11. Qb4 Rc8 12. Rfc1 {Uusi,G-Ivanov,V Riga 1961 (1-0, 32)}) 10. Be5 (10. Bg5 h6 11. Bh4 g5 12. Nd2 (12. Ne5 Nxe5 13. dxe5 gxh4 14. Bxh5 Bxe5 15. Qxd5 Qxd5 16. Nxd5 {Gross,G (2350)-Becking,S (2406) Germany 2010 (½-½, 37)} Bd6) (12. Bg3 Nxg3 13. hxg3 e6 14. Ne1 Bd7 15. Nd3 f5 16. f4 g4 17. Nc5 Rb8 18. Bb5 Qe7 19. Rc1 Be8 20. Bxc6 Bxc6 21. Nd3 h5 22. Kf2 Rf6 $132 {Sakharov,Y-Bannik,A Kiev 1959 (½-½, 41)}) 12... e5 $1 (12... Nf4 13. exf4 gxh4 14. Nf3 h3 15. g3 Bf5 16. Rc1 e6 {=/}) (12... gxh4 13. Bxh5 e5 14. dxe5 d4 15. exd4 Qxd4 16. Nf3 Qxd1 17. Raxd1 Nxe5 {Ruzele,D (2550)-Mozeris,V (2050) Platelia 2001 (½-½, 29)} 18. Nxh4 $14 Nc4 19. Nd5) 13. dxe5 (13. Bxh5 exd4 14. exd4 gxh4 15. Nf3 Be6 $11) 13... d4 14. exd4 (14. Nce4 gxh4 15. Bxh5 Nxe5 $11) 14... Nf4 15. Bg3 Qxd4 $132) 10... f6 11. Bg3 Nxg3 12. hxg3 Be6 13. Qb3 ({If White plays in the centre, trying to prevent ...e7-e5, Black can regroup quietly, since his two bishops insure him against any kind of problems.} 13. Qd2 Bf7 14. Rfd1 {Meduna,E (2485)-Armas,J (2480) Germany 1990 (1-0, 28)} Rc8 15. Rac1 e6 16. a3 Re8 {[%cal Gg7f8,Gh7h5,Gg6g5]}) 13... Na5 14. Qb4 Bf7 15. Rfd1 e6 16. e4 Rb8 17. Qa3 b5 $5 $132 18. b4 Nc4 19. Qxa7 Be8 (19... Re8 {[%cal Ge8e7]} 20. Bxc4 Ra8 21. Qxf7+ Kxf7 22. Bxb5 Re7 23. exd5 exd5 24. Bc6 Rc8 25. b5 Rxc6 26. bxc6 Rc7 $13) (19... Ra8 20. Qb7 (20. Qc5 Na3 $11) 20... Rb8 21. Qa6 Qd7 (21... Qe7) 22. exd5 $2 {Alarcon Casellas,R (2399)-Casal Roses,A (2212) Havana 2009 (½-½, 28)} Rb6 $19) 20. Bxc4 Rf7 (20... Ra8 21. Qc5 $16) 21. Qa3 (21. Qa6 $1 Rb6 (21... bxc4 22. Qxe6) 22. Qa5 {[%csl Gd5][%cal Ga5d5]} dxc4) 21... bxc4 22. exd5 exd5 23. Qb2 $14 g5 24. Qd2 Rxb4 25. Nxd5 Rb8 26. Ne3 Rc8 27. Rac1 Rfc7 28. Rc3 Bg6 29. Rdc1 Bf7 30. d5 Bf8 31. a3 Bc5 32. Rxc4 Bxa3 33. Rxc7 Rxc7 34. Rxc7 Qxc7 35. Qd4 Qc1+ 36. Kh2 Qb2 37. Qe4 Bf8 38. Nd4 h5 39. Ndc2 Qb7 40. Nd4 Qb2 41. Ne6 Qxf2 42. Nf5 h4 43. Nxf8 hxg3+ 44. Kh3 Qg1 45. Kxg3 Kxf8 46. Qe7+ 1-0

