1. c4 e5 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. Nf3 Nc6 4. g3 Bc5 5. Bg2 (5. Nxe5 $6 Bxf2+ 6. Kxf2 Nxe5 7. e4 c5 8. d3 d6 9. h3 $13 {Botvinnik,M-Keres,P/URS/1966/} O-O 10. Be2 Ne8 11. Kg2 Nc7 12. Be3 Ne6) 5... d6 6. O-O O-O 7. d3 (7. e3 Re8 8. d4 Bb6 9. h3 h6 10. a3 a5 11. b3 Bf5 12. Bb2 Qd7 13. Kh2 Rad8 14. Nd5 $6 Nxd5 15. cxd5 Ne7 16. dxe5 Be4 $1 $15 {Uhlmann,W-Knaak,R/Halle/1974/}) 7... h6 8. a3 (8. e3 Re8 9. d4 Bb4 10. Nd5 e4 11. Nd2 Bxd2 12. Bxd2 Bf5 13. f3 Bh7 14. Nxf6+ Qxf6 15. fxe4 Qe7 16. Qb3 Nd8 17. e5 dxe5 18. d5 $16 {Alburt,L-Sigurjonsson,G/Lone Pine/1979/1-0/61/}) 8... a6 $6 (8... a5 9. e3 Bf5 (9... Bb6 10. b3 Bf5 11. h3 Qd7 12. Kh2 Bh7 13. Ng1 Kh8 14. Nge2 Rfe8 15. Bb2 Nd8 16. Qd2 c6 17. e4 Ng8 18. Na4 Bc7 19. d4 {Gurevich,M-Sokolov,I/Belgrade/1991/1-0/52/}) 10. h3 (10. b3 Qd7 11. Bb2 Bb6 12. d4 exd4 13. exd4 Bg4 14. Na4 Ba7 15. Qd2 Rfe8 16. Rae1 d5 17. Rxe8+ Rxe8 18. Ne5 Ne4 {Vaganian,R-Sokolov,I/Bled\Rogaska Slatina/1991/0-1/39/}) 10... Qd7 11. Kh2 e4 12. Ne1 exd3 13. Nxd3 Bxd3 14. Qxd3 a4 15. Bd2 Na5 16. Rad1 Bb6 17. Nb5 Nb3 18. Bb4 {Lautier,J-Hertneck,G/Tilburg/1992/1-0/41/}) 9. b4 Ba7 10. Bb2 Bf5 11. Nh4 Bd7 12. Rc1 Ne8 $6 13. Nd5 g5 $6 14. Nf3 f5 15. Nd2 $14 Nd4 16. c5 $1 c6 17. Nb6 $1 (17. Ne3 f4 18. Nec4 Bg4) 17... Bxb6 18. cxb6 Qxb6 {Now White wins the control at the dark squares.} 19. Nc4 Qa7 {prevents f2-f4} 20. e3 Ne6 21. d4 exd4 22. exd4 d5 {Black has tom close the a1-h8 diagonal.} 23. Ne5 Nf6 24. Re1 Ng7 25. a4 {Black has protected the kingside very well. Now White starts a minority attack on the queenside.} Qb6 26. Ba3 Rfe8 27. Qd3 Qd8 28. Re2 Ng4 29. b5 axb5 30. axb5 Nxe5 $2 {helps to open the a1-h8 diagonal.} 31. dxe5 f4 32. bxc6 bxc6 33. Bd6 Ra4 34. Rb2 Qa8 35. Bf1 Ra2 36. Rxa2 Qxa2 37. Qc3 {a1} fxg3 38. hxg3 Qa7 39. Bd3 Ne6 40. Bg6 Ra8 41. Qf3 Be8 42. Qf6 Bxg6 43. Qxg6+ Ng7 44. e6 Qd4 45. Qf7+ Kh7 46. Bf8 1-0

