1. e4 {Gligoric,Svetozar Gligoric,Svetozar Myers Gligoric,Svetozar} e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nd2 c5 4. exd5 exd5 5. Bb5+ Bd7 6. Qe2+ Be7 7. dxc5 Nf6 8. Nb3 O-O 9. Nf3 Re8 10. Be3 a6 {Recommended after Baguio 1978.} (10... Bxc5 11. Nxc5 Qa5+ 12. Qd2 Qxb5 13. O-O-O $16 {Karpov,An-Kortschnoj,V (22)/Wch Baguio/1-0/1978/}) 11. Bd3 (11. Bxd7 {Tal,M-Karpov,An/Montreal (07)/1979/½-½/}) 11... Ba4 12. Nfd4 Nbd7 13. O-O-O $1 (13. O-O {Gligoric,Svetozar: 'Ü 26/234'} Bxb3 14. Nxb3 Nxc5 $10 {Larsen,B-Portisch,L/Tilburg/1978/}) 13... Nxc5 (13... Bxb3 $1 14. Nxb3 a5 $1 15. Nd4 Bxc5 16. Qf3 a4 17. a3 Ne5 $15 {Yakovich,Y-Sherieshevsky,M/URS/1985/}) 14. Nf5 Bf8 15. Nxc5 (15. Qf3 Nxd3+ 16. Rxd3 Bb5 17. Rdd1 Bc4 $132 {Portisch Portisch Portisch Myers: '(Portisch 79)'}) 15... Bxc5 16. Qf3 Bxe3+ 17. Nxe3 $14 {Myers: '(Keene/Taulbut 84)'} (17. fxe3 $6 Bd7 (17... Qc7 {Myers}) 18. g4 Bxf5 (18... Re5) 19. Bxf5 Qe7) 17... Rc8 {Gligoric,Svetozar: '?!'} (17... Bc6 18. Nf5) 18. Bf5 {Gligoric,Svetozar: '!' Gligoric,Svetozar: '[d5]'} Rc5 $5 {Gligoric,Svetozar: ''} (18... Qc7 19. Bxc8 $2 (19. Kb1 $142 {Myers: '!'}) 19... Rxe3 $1 20. Qf5 g6 $19 {Myers: '(Keene/Taulbut 84)'} 21. Qxf6 Qxc2#) 19. Rd4 (19. Qf4 $5 Bc6 20. b4) 19... Bc6 {Myers: '"... when one might expect 20 hd1, followed by a methodical seige of d5, Tal embarks on an amazing, imaginative and double-edged venture to persecute Black's somewhat exposed rook on c5." (Keene/Taulbut 84)'} (19... Bd7 $2 {Gligoric,Svetozar: '!?'}) 20. b4 $5 {Gligoric,Svetozar: '!'} (20. Rhd1 $14 {×d5}) 20... Rb5 (20... Rc3 21. Kb2) 21. a4 (21. Bd3 $2 Rxb4 22. Rxb4 d4 $44 {Myers: '(Portisch 79)'}) 21... Rb6 {Myers: '!'} (21... Rxb4 $2 22. Rxb4 d4 23. Qd1 {Myers: '"... forcing the exchange of Queens." (Keene/Taulbut 84, Portisch 79)'} dxe3 24. Qxd8 Rxd8 25. fxe3 Bxg2 26. Rd1 Re8 27. Bd7 $1 Rxe3 28. Bc8 $18 {Tal}) 22. a5 Rb5 {Myers: '?!' Myers: '"It was difficult to realize, having rejected ...xb4 the previous move, that now was the time to sacrifice the rook." (Keene/Ta