+ gxf6 18. Bd2 {Tal,Mihail: '!'} Nd3 {Tal,Mihail: '!'} 19. Bc3 Rfd8 $1 (19... Rad8 {Tal,Mihail} 20. Qa4 $1 Nxe1 21. Qg4+ Ng7 22. Bxf6 $18) 20. Re2 Rd6 $13) (16. a3 Bxc3 {Tal,Mihail: '!?'} 17. bxc3 Nxd5 18. Qd3 g6 19. c4 Nb6 20. Qc3 $44 {is an interesting pawn sacrifice, suggested by Tal. However, it hardly leads to an advantage after} c5 $5) 16... Ne7 $2 (16... Nh4 17. Nxh4 Bxh4 18. a3 Na6 19. Bf4 $14 {[%csl Ra6]}) (16... Nd6 $142 $1 {Tal,Mihail: '!?'} 17. a3 (17. g5 Bxc3 18. bxc3 Na6 19. Ba3 Qd7 $132) (17. Bf4 {Tal,Mihail} Nc4 $1 18. Qb3 Nxb2 $1 $17) 17... Na6 18. Bf4 Qd7 19. h3 $13 {Tal}) 17. g5 {Tal,Mihail: ''} Bxc3 18. bxc3 Na6 (18... Nbxd5 $2 19. c4 $18) 19. c4 Ng6 20. Ba3 (20. Qd4 {Tal,Mihail} c5 $5) 20... Re8 21. Qd4 c5 22. Qc3 $1 $16 {[%csl Rg7]} (22. Bxc5 {Tal,Mihail: '?!'} Nxc5 23. Qxc5 Qd7 {[%csl Rg1]}) 22... Qd6 (22... Rf8 {Tal,Mihail: '!?'} 23. Bb2 f6 24. Qe3 $16 (24. Re3 $5) (24. Nd2 $5)) 23. Bb2 f6 24. gxf6 Qxf6 (24... gxf6 25. Ng5 $1 $18 {[%cal Rg5e6,Rg5e4]}) 25. Nd2 (25. a3 $5 Qxc3 26. Bxc3 $16) 25... Qg5+ $2 (25... Qxc3 $142 26. Bxc3 Nb4 $14 (26... Rf8 $5 {Tal,Mihail} 27. Ne4 Rf4 $16)) 26. Kh1 $40 {[%csl Rg7,Rg8][%cal Gg1g8,Ga1g7]} Rxe1+ 27. Rxe1 Nf4 28. Qf3 $18 {[%cal Re1g1]} (28. Rg1 $4 {Tal,Mihail} Qxg1+ $19) 28... Ng6 29. Ne4 Qh6 30. Nd6 (30. Bc1 $142 {Tal,Mihail: '+-'} Qh4 (30... Ne5 31. Qg3 $18) 31. Ng5 (31. Bg5 $18) 31... Rf8 32. Re8 $1 $18) 30... Rf8 31. Re8 Qf4 32. Qxf4 Nxf4 33. Re7 Nh5 34. Rxb7 Nb4 (34... Rxf2 35. Kg1 Rc2 36. a3 $1 $18 {[%csl Ra6]}) 35. Ne4 Nd3 36. d6 Rd8 37. Bc3 Nhf4 (37... Nhf4 38. Rxg7+ Kf8 39. d7 $18) 1-0

