1. d4 {1) Tal in Shakhmaty 1960. Reprinted in 2) Kirillov,V: Mikhail Tal 1949-1961. Riga. 1996. p.197-199.} Nf6 2. c4 c6 3. Nc3 d5 4. Nf3 g6 5. Bf4 (5. cxd5 cxd5 6. Bf4) 5... Bg7 (5... dxc4 6. e3 Nd5 7. Be5 f6 8. Bxb8 {[%cal Gf1c4];1-0 Geller,E-Barcza,G Budapest 1952 (3)}) 6. e3 O-O 7. Be2 (7. Rc1) 7... c5 $1 8. dxc5 Qa5 9. O-O (9. cxd5 Nxd5 10. Qxd5 Bxc3+ 11. Kf1 Bxb2) (9. Qa4 Qxc5 10. Qb5 Qxb5 11. Nxb5 Na6) 9... dxc4 10. Bxc4 Qxc5 11. Ne5 (11. Bb3 Nc6 $11) 11... Nbd7 {Mikhalchishin: 'Diagram '} (11... Nc6 12. Na4 Qa5 13. Nxc6) 12. Bxf7+ $1 {Mikhalchishin: '!!'} Rxf7 13. Nxf7 Kxf7 14. Qb3+ Kf8 (14... e6 15. Nb5) 15. Rac1 {[%cal Rc3b5,Gb5c7,Gc7e6]} a6 (15... Qb6 16. Qc4 (16. Nb5 Ne8 {Keres})) 16. Rfd1 {[%cal Rc3d5]} Qa5 {[%cal Gd7c5]} (16... Qb6 17. Qa3 (17. Qxb6 Nxb6 18. Rd8+ Kf7)) (16... b5 17. Nd5 $18) 17. Qc4 $1 Qf5 (17... Nc5 $2 18. b4 $18) (17... Nb6 18. Rd8+ {Mikhalchishin: '+-'}) (17... Ne5 18. Bxe5 Qxe5 19. Rd8+) (17... b5 18. Qc6 {Mikhalchishin: '+-'}) 18. h3 {[%cal Rg2g4]} Ne8 (18... Nh5 19. g4 $18) 19. Nd5 Qe6 (19... e5 20. Qb4+) (19... Ndf6 20. Nb6 $18) 20. Qb4 b5 {[%cal Rc8b7]} (20... Be5 {Keres} 21. Rc4 (21. Bxe5 Qxe5 22. Qh4 h5 23. Rc4)) 21. Rc6 $1 (21. Nc7 Nxc7 22. Rxc7 Kf7) 21... Qf7 (21... Qxc6 22. Qxe7+ Kg8 23. Qxe8+ $18) 22. Nc7 Nxc7 23. Rxc7 Qe6 24. Rdc1 Nb6 (24... Ne5 25. Qe4) 25. Rxe7 (25. R1c6) 25... Nd5 (25... Qxe7 26. Bd6 $18) 26. Rxe6+ Nxb4 27. Bd6+ Kf7 28. Re7+ {1-0 (28) Tal,M-Johannessen,S Riga 1959 MCD [Mikhalchishin]} 1-0

