1. e4 {Wells} c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 Nc6 6. Bg5 e6 7. Qd2 Be7 8. O-O-O O-O 9. Nb3 a5 10. a4 (10. Nd4 a4 11. a3 d5 12. exd5 Nxd5 13. Bxe7 Ncxe7 14. Bc4 Qa5 15. Nxd5 Nxd5 16. Qxa5 Rxa5 17. Nf5 Nf6 18. Nd6 Bd7 19. Nxb7 Rg5 20. Rhg1 Bc6 21. Nd8 Bd7 {= Jansa - Pavlovic, Nis, 1985}) 10... d5 {Wells: 'No longer fully respectable. If Black could release the tension so early, 9 b3 would be out of commission.'} 11. Bb5 dxe4 $146 {Wells: '?!'} (11... Nxe4 {Ü 39/235}) (11... Nb4 {Wells is rather better, although then too White has a decent choice between the 'French-style'} 12. e5 {or keeping the tension with} (12. Rhe1 $5)) 12. Qxd8 Bxd8 (12... Rxd8 $6 13. Nxe4 Nxe4 14. Bxe7 Rxd1+ 15. Rxd1 $16 Nxf2 16. Rd2 Ne4 $13) 13. Rhe1 $5 {!} (13. Bxf6 Bxf6 14. Nxe4 $13) (13. Kb1 e5 14. h3 Nb4 15. Nc5 Bf5 $15) 13... Na7 (13... Bb6 14. Bxf6 gxf6 15. Nxe4 f5 16. Nf6+ Kg7 17. Nd7 $1 {!} Bxf2 18. Re2 Bxd7 19. Rxd7 $16) (13... h6 {!?} 14. Bxf6 Bxf6 15. Nxe4 $14 {Tal}) 14. Bc4 {!} (14. Bf1 {=}) 14... h6 {?!} (14... Nc6 {!?} 15. Nc5 $16 {!?} (15. h3 b6 16. Bxf6 Bxf6 17. Nxe4 Be5 18. g3 $13)) 15. Bxf6 gxf6 (15... Bxf6 16. Nxe4 { d6} Be7 (16... b6 17. Nxf6+ gxf6 18. Rd6 Rb8 19. Red1 $16) 17. Nbc5 b6 18. Nd7 Bxd7 19. Rxd7 $14) 16. Nxe4 {Wells: 'Black has holes, dubious structure and developmental problems - an opening experiment not to repeat!'} f5 17. Nd6 Bc7 18. g3 $1 {!} (18. Re3 Rd8 19. Red3 Nc6 $11 {=}) (18. Nc5 $5 {!?} b6 19. Nxc8 Bf4+ $8 (19... Raxc8 20. Nxe6 $1 {'' !}) 20. Kb1 Raxc8 $1 {!} (20... Rfxc8 21. Nd7 Bc7 (21... Rc6 22. Bb5) (21... Rxc4 22. Nxb6 Rac8 23. Nxc8 Rxc8 24. Rd7 $14) (21... Rc7 22. Ba6) 22. Ba6) 21. Nxe6 Rxc4 22. Nxf8 Kxf8 23. Rd7 Nc6 $13 {Tal}) (18. Re2 Rd8 19. Red2 $14) 18... b6 $2 {?} (18... Rd8 {!?} 19. Nb5 (19. Nxf5 $6 {?!} Rxd1+ 20. Kxd1 exf5 21. Re7 Bd6 22. Rxf7 Kh8 $13) (19. Nxc8 Raxc8 20. Rxd8+ Rxd8 21. Rd1 $14) 19... Nxb5 20. Bxb5 $14 {Tal}) 19. Nxf5 $1 $18 {Wells: '!' !!} (19. f4 Bd7 20. Nxf5 Bxa4 21. Nxh6+ Kg7 22. Ng4 b5 23. Bd3 Bxb3 24. cxb3 $14 {/}) 19... exf5 20. Bd5 Be6 (20... Rb8 {?} 21. Re7 {'+-'}) 21. Bxa8 Rxa8 (21... Bxb3 $142 {%03'better is'} 22. Rd7 Bxa4 23. Rxc7 Rxa8 24. Ree7 {'' Tal}) 22. Nd4 Bd5 (22... Re8 23. Nxf5 (23. Nxe6 fxe6 24. Rd7 Bb8 25. Rb7 Nc6 26. Rxb6 Nd4 27. f4 $18)) (22... Bd7 23. Re7 $18) 23. Re7 (23. Nxf5 Be6) 23... Rc8 (23... Bd8 24. Nxf5 {'+-'}) 24. Nb5 {Wells: '!'} (24. Nb5 {!} Nxb5 (24... Z0) 25. Rxd5 Nd6 26. Rxc7 Rxc7 27. Rxd6 $18) 1-0

