{[%mdl 8192] B12: Caro-Kann: Advance Variation} 1. e4 g6 2. d4 c6 3. c4 d5 4. e5 Bg7 5. Nc3 Nh6 6. h4 Be6 7. Nge2 dxc4 8. Nf4 Bd5 9. b3 cxb3 10. axb3 {last book move} e6 {Secures d5} 11. Bd3 Nf5 12. Bxf5 exf5 13. Ba3 {Black cannot castle king side} Bf8 (13... Be6 14. Bd6 Bf8 15. Bxf8 Kxf8 16. h5 $14) 14. Bxf8 $16 Kxf8 15. Qd2 Be6 {Black has a cramped position} 16. Rd1 Qe7 17. Rh3 {White loses the right to castle} (17. d5 Bxd5 18. Ncxd5 cxd5 $18) 17... Na6 $2 (17... Bxb3 $142 {would keep Black in the game} 18. Rb1 Bc4 $11) 18. d5 $18 cxd5 $4 {leading to a quick end} (18... Rd8 $142 $18) 19. Nfxd5 Bxd5 20. Nxd5 (20. Qh6+ $142 {secures the point} Kg8 21. Nxd5 Qxe5+ 22. Re3 $18) 20... Qxe5+ 21. Re3 Qd6 (21... Qg7 {is not much help} 22. Nb6 $3 {Clearance: d5} Kg8 23. Nxa8 $18) 22. Qc3 (22. Qb2 $142 {and White has it in the bag} Rg8 23. Nf6 Qb4+ 24. Rd2 $18) 22... f6 23. Nc7 (23. Nc7 Qc6 24. Nxa8 Qxc3+ 25. Rxc3 $18) 1-0

