(24... axb5 $4 25. Qxb5+ Kc7 26. Qb7+ Kd6 27. Qd7#) 25. Rxe4 {Cyrus Lakdawala: '!' '!' Huebner,R: ''} Qxe4 {/-+ /-+ Cyrus Lakdawala: '!' '!'/-+ Garry Kasparov: 'Huebner: '/-+''' ' Cyrus Lakdawala: 'Keller finds the best defence, giving up his queen for close to sufficient compensation.' Huebner: '/-+ Huebner,Robert: '/-+''} ({Cyrus Lakdawala: 'Instead,' Huebner: 'Garry Kasparov: 'After''} 25... Rxe4 {Cyrus Lakdawala: '?' '?' Huebner,R: '?!' Huebner: 'Garry Kasparov: '?!' '?!''} 26. Nd4+ {+- Unzicker Huebner,R: '''+- Unzicker Garry Kasparov: 'Huebner: '+- Unzicker'''} Nb4 {Huebner,R: ''} 27. Qd7+ (27. Qc6+ Kb8 28. Qd7 (28. Rxb4+ Bxb4 29. Qb6+ Kc8 30. Qc6+ Kb8 31. Qb6+ Kc8 32. Qc6+ Kb8 $11) 28... Re1+ 29. Kg2 Qe4+ 30. Kh3 Qxb1 31. cxb4 Bxd4 32. e8=Q+ Rxe8 33. Qd6+ $11) 27... Qc7 {Huebner: 'Garry Kasparov: 'White retains an advantage, both in the middlegame –''} 28. Rxb4+ {Cyrus Lakdawala: '!' '!' Huebner,R: '!?'} ({Huebner: 'Garry Kasparov: 'and in the endgame –''} 28. Qd5+ $6 {'Garry Kasparov: 'Huebner: '?!'''} Ka7 29. Qxe4 Qxe7 {Clarke'Clarke Garry Kasparov: 'Huebner: 'Clarke'''} 30. Qxe7+ {Hübner Huebner: 'Hübner Huebner,R'Hübner Garry Kasparov: 'Huebner: 'Hübner''' obert: 'Hübner''} Bxe7 31. cxb4 Kb7 (31... Rc8 32. Kf1 c3 33. Nc2) 32. Rc1 Rc8 33. Kf1 {/+- ×  Huebner,R: '=' Huebner: '/+- ×  Huebner,Robert: '/+- × ''}) 28... Bxb4 29. Qd5+ Kb8 30. Qxe4 ({Huebner: 'Garry Kasparov: 'or''} 30. Nc6+ Kc8 (30... Qxc6 31. Qxc6 Re1+ 32. Kg2 Bxe7 $11) 31. Qxe4) 30... Bxe7 31. Nc6+ Kb7 32. Nxe7+ Ka7 33. Nc6+ Kb7 $10 {Clarke'Clarke Garry Kasparov: 'Huebner: '=' Huebner: 'Clarke'''} 34. Nd8+ (34. Nb4+ Ka7 (34... Kb8 35. Qxh7 Ka7 36. Qe4 Rc8 37. Qd4+ Kb7 38. Qd5+ Ka7 39. h4 $16 {Myers}) 35. Qd4+ Kb7 36. Qxf6 {leaves Black fighting for his life. Huebner: 'etc.'}) 34... Kb8 35. Qd5 (35. Nc6+ Kc8 36. Qxc4 $14) 35... Ka7 36. Qd4+ Kb8 37. Qxf6 $13) 26. Nd6+ {Cyrus Lakdawala: 'Double check.'} Kc7 ({Not} 26... Ka7 $4 27. Rb7# {.}) 27. Nxe4 Rxe4 28. Qd1 {Cyrus Lakdawala: '