{[%mdl 64] B80: Sicilian Scheveningen: 6 g3 and 6 Be3, including English Attack} 1. e4 {Fritz 5.00 (5s)} c5 {Fritz 5.00 (5s): 'Opening = B80_03 Sicil Scheveninger mit 6.g3 / Sicil Scheveninger with 6.g3'} 2. Nf3 e6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 d6 6. g3 a6 7. Bg2 Qc7 8. O-O Be7 9. f4 Nc6 10. Nxc6 bxc6 11. e5 dxe5 12. fxe5 Nd7 13. Bf4 O-O 14. Ne4 {Fritz 5.00 (5s): 'last book move'} Bb7 {last book move Fritz 5.00 (5s): '='} (14... Nxe5 $5 {Fritz 5.00 (5s)} 15. Qd4 f6 $15) 15. Qh5 {Black king safety dropped Fritz 5.00 (5s): ''} (15. Qd4 $5 $11 {Fritz 5.00 (5s)}) 15... g6 {Black threatens to win material: g6xh5} 16. Qe2 {Fritz 5.00 (5s): 'White gets deadly initiative'} c5 {Fritz 5.00 (5s): '='} (16... Nxe5 {Fritz 5.00 (5s)} 17. Ng5 $15) 17. Nf6+ Bxf6 {Fritz 5.00 (5s): 'The pressure on the isolated pawn grows'} (17... Nxf6 $4 {Fritz 5.00 (5s)} 18. exf6 Qd8 19. Bxb7 (19. fxe7 $6 Qxe7 20. Bxb7 Qxb7 $18) 19... Bxf6 20. Bxa8 Bxb2 21. Rad1 Qxa8 22. Be3 $18) 18. exf6 e5 {Fritz 5.00 (5s): ''} (18... Qb6 $5 {Fritz 5.00 (5s)} 19. Bxb7 Qxb7 $11) 19. Bxe5 {Deflection: b7. Fritz 5.00 (5s): 'White creates threats along the open e-file'} Nxe5 {Fritz 5.00 (5s): ''} (19... Qxe5 20. Bxb7 {Overloading Deflection} (20. Qxe5 {Fritz 5.00 (5s)} Nxe5 21. Bxb7 $16)) (19... Nxe5 20. Bxb7 Qxb7 21. Qxe5 {Overloading Deflection}) (19... Z0 $140 20. Bxc7 {Wins material}) 20. Bxb7 Rab8 {[%cal Yc5c4] Black prepares c4} (20... Qxb7 $142 $5 {must be considered} 21. Qxe5 Rae8 $11) 21. Bd5 {Fritz 5.00 (5s): '='} (21. Bxa6 $5 {Fritz 5.00 (5s)} Rxb2 22. Rfb1 Rxb1+ 23. Rxb1 $14) 21... Rb6 {Fritz 5.00 (5s): '+-?'} (21... c4 $142 22. Rae1 (22. b4 {Fritz 5.00 (5s)} Rxb4 $11) 22... Rfd8 23. Qxe5 Qc5+ 24. Rf2 Qxd5 $16) 22. Rae1 Nd7 23. Qe7 c4 (23... Rxb2 {Fritz 5.00 (5s)} 24. Be6 Rb7 25. Rb1 $16) 24. Kh1 {Fritz 5.00 (5s): ''} (24. b4 $142 $5 $18 {Fritz 5.00 (5s)}) 24... Rxb2 {Fritz 5.00 (5s): '+-?'} (24... Rb5 {Fritz 5.00 (5s)} 25. Rd1 Rxb2 $18) 25. Re6 $3 {Deflection: f7 Fritz 5.00 (5s): '!'} Rbb8 (25... fxe6 26. Qg7# {Mate attack Deflection}) (25... Rxa2 $4 {Fritz 5.00 (5s)} 26. Rd6 Qxd6 27. Qxd6 Rxc2 28. Qxd7 $18) 26. Rd6 Rbd8 27. Rd1 Qa5 {Fritz 5.00 (5s)} 28. Rxd7 Rxd7 29. Qxd7 $18 1-0

