1. e4 {[%mdl 4] Myers Euwe Yudovich Myers Euwe Yudovich: 'Myers Euwe Yudovich'} c6 2. c4 {This is another way to reach our variation. Ein anderer Weg, diese Variante zu erreichen.} d5 3. exd5 cxd5 4. d4 Nf6 5. Nc3 Nc6 6. Bg5 Bg4 {Myers Euwe Yudovich: '?!'} ({This move is rarely played nowadays. Black normally plays: Dieser Zug wird heute selten gespielt. Schwarz spielt normalerweise:} 6... e6) (6... Be6) (6... Qa5) 7. Be2 {Myers Euwe Yudovich: '!'} Bxe2 8. Ngxe2 dxc4 ({Inferior is Schlechter ist} 8... e6 9. cxd5 exd5 10. Qb3 $16 {[%cal Yb4b7,Yb3d5,Yb3b7]}) 9. d5 {Myers Euwe Yudovich: '!'} Ne5 10. O-O {Although Black is a pawn ahead his position is inferior because he is behind in development. Obwohl Schwarz einen Mehrbauern besitzt, ist seine Stellung schlechter, weil er schlechter entwickelt ist.} h6 $6 ({Better is Besser ist} 10... e6 11. Qd4 {Myers Euwe Yudovich: '!'} (11. Bxf6 {Myers Euwe Yudovich} gxf6 12. Qa4+ Qd7 13. Nb5 Rc8 14. dxe6 {Kondratiev} fxe6 15. Rfd1 Nd3 $15 {Myers}) 11... h6 12. Qxe5 hxg5 13. dxe6 Bd6 14. Qb5+ Kf8 15. Ng3 Qb6 16. Qxc4 Bxg3 (16... Rh4 $5) 17. hxg3 Qxe6 18. Qb5 (18. Qc5+ Kg8) 18... Re8 19. Qxg5 Rh5 20. Qf4 g5 21. Qd4 Ng4 22. Rad1 Rh1+ {0-1 Mortensen,E-Birnboim,N/Haifa 1976/EXT 2000 (22). Myers Euwe Yudovich: '0-1 Mortensen,E-Birnboim,N/Haifa ISR 1976/'}) (10... g6 {Myers Euwe Yudovich} 11. Bxf6 (11. d6 $1 exd6 $2 12. Qa4+ $1 Ned7 13. Bxf6 Qxf6 14. Nd5 Qd8 15. Qxc4 $18 {Myers}) 11... exf6 12. Qa4+ Qd7 13. Nb5 Rc8 14. d6 a6 15. Nc7+ Kd8 16. Qa5 Bxd6 17. Nd5+ {½-½ Adamski,J-Sydor,A/Piotrkow Trybunalski POL 1977/}) (10... Nfd7 {Myers Euwe Yudovich} 11. d6 f6 (11... Qa5 12. dxe7 Nf3+ 13. Kh1 Nxg5 14. exf8=Q+ Rxf8 15. Qd4 Qc5 16. Qxg7 f6 17. h4 Rf7 18. Qg8+ Rf8 19. Qd5 Qxd5 20. Nxd5 Ne6 21. Rac1 Rc8 22. Rfe1 Kf7 23. Nd4 Ne5 24. Nxe6 {½-½ Ledezma Alvarez,J-Fernandez Oteiza,A/corr CADAP 1979/}) 12. Nd5 exd6 13. Nd4 (13. Nef4 Nc5 14. Re1 fxg5 15. Qh5+ Kd7 16. Rxe5 dxe5 17. Rd1 Bd6 18. Qh3+ Kc6 19. Ne2 Qf8 20. b4 cxb3 21. axb3 a5 22. Qc3 b6 23. Qc4 b5 24. Qg4 h5 25. Qg3 b4 26. Qe3 Rh6 27. Ng3 Rd8 28. Qxg5 g6 29. Qc1 Rh8 30. Ne4 Be7 31. Qc4 g5 32. Nxc5 Bxc5 33. Qa6+ Kd7 34. Nf4+ Bd4 35. Qe6+ Kc7 36. Rc1+ Kb8 37. Qc6 Qd6 {0-1 Wadsack,W-Wolfram,B/Austria OST 2002/}) 13... Kf7 14. f4 Nc6 15. Nb5 Nb6 16. Nbc7 Ne7 17. Nxb6 Qxc7 18. Nxa8 Qc5+ 19. Kh1 Nd5 20. Qe2 Be7 21. f5 Rxa8 22. Rad1 Nc7 23. Be3 Qc6 24. Rf4 d5 25. Qh5+ Kf8 26. Qxh7 Ke8 27. Qxg7 Kd7 28. Rh4 Re8 29. Qg4 Kc8 30. Rh7 Bd8 31. Bg1 Re4 32. Qg8 Re2 33. Rh8 Re8 34. Qg7 Rxh8 35. Qxh8 Qd7 36. Qh5 Ne8 37. Qf3 Nc7 38. h4 Be7 39. Bh2 d4 40. Bxc7 Kxc7 41. Qf4+ {1-0 Aguilar,A-Pedro,F/Argentina ARG 2006/}) 11. Bf4 {Myers Euwe Yudovich: '!'} (11. Bh4 g6 (11... Nfd7 {Myers Euwe Yudovich} 12. d6 g5 13. dxe7 Bxe7 14. Bg3 O-O 15. Nd4 Re8 16. Nd5 Bf8 17. Nb5 Rc8 18. Nxa7 Rc5 19. b4 cxb3 20. axb3 Nb6 21. Ne3 Qxd1 22. Rfxd1 Bg7 23. b4 Rc7 24. Nb5 {½-½ Kalod,R-Vavra,P/Usti nad Labem U20 CZE 1996/})) 11... Ng6 {Myers Euwe Yudovich: '?!'} (11... Nd3 $142 $5 {Myers Euwe Yudovich} 12. Qa4+ Qd7 13. Qxc4 Nxb2 14. Qd4 Rc8 15. Rab1 Nc4 16. Qxa7 $14 {Myers}) 12. Qa4+ {Myers Euwe Yudovich: '!'} Qd7 (12... Nd7 {Myers Euwe Yudovich} 13. Qxc4 Nxf4 14. Nxf4 a6 15. Rfe1 Nb6 16. Qe4 Qd6 17. Rac1 Rd8 18. Ne6 Rc8 19. Qg4 Rc4 20. Ne4 Qxd5 21. Nxg7+ Bxg7 22. Qxg7 Qd4 23. Nf6+ {1-0 Clari-Fiol/corr ESP 1982/}) 13. Qxc4 Rc8 14. Qb3 {White has regained a pawn and Black has not managed to develop his pieces. White has a clear advantage. Weiß hat seinen Bauern zurückgewonnen und Schwarz hat es nicht geschafft, seine Figuren zu entwickeln. Weiß steht klar besser.} e5 {Myers Euwe Yudovich: '?'} (14... Nxf4 {Myers Euwe Yudovich: '!?'} 15. Nxf4 g5 (15... g6 {Myers Euwe Yudovich} 16. Nd3 Bg7 17. Ne5 Qd6 18. Qxb7 O-O 19. Rfe1 Rc7 20. Qb3 a6 21. Rad1 Rfc8 22. a3 Ne8 23. Nxf7 Kxf7 24. Ne4 {1-0 Topot,I-Van Alphen,J/corr IECG 2004/}) 16. Ne6 {Myers Euwe Yudovich: '!' Myers Euwe Yudovich: 'Tal'} (16. Nd3 $16 {[%csl Ye5][%cal Yd3e5,Yf1e1,Ya1d1] Myers Euwe Yudovich: '!?'} Bg7 {Myers Euwe Yudovich} 17. Ne5 Qd6 18. Rfe1 Qb6 19. Qa4+ Kf8 20. Nd7+ Nxd7 21. Qxd7 Re8 22. Re2 $16 {Myers}) 16... fxe6 (16... Rxc3 {Myers Euwe Yudovich} 17. Qxc3 (17. bxc3 $142 $1 fxe6 18. dxe6 Qc6 19. Rab1 Bg7 20. Qxb7 Qxe6 21. Rfe1 $16 {Myers}) 17... fxe6 18. dxe6 Qxe6 19. Rfe1 Qc6 20. Qe5 Kf7 21. Rac1 Qb5 22. Rc7 h5 23. a4 Rg8 24. a5 Qa6 25. h4 g4 26. Rxe7+ Bxe7 27. Qxe7+ Kg6 28. Re6 Qxe6 29. Qxe6 Re8 30. Qd6 Kf7 31. Qb8 Rxb8 {0-1 Laurencena,A-Pereyra Puebla,M/corr ARG 1992/}) 17. dxe6 Qc6 (17... Qd6 {Myers Euwe Yudovich} 18. Nb5 Qb6 19. Qa4 Rc6 20. Rfd1 a6 $11 {Myers}) 18. Rac1 $18 {Tal Tal}) 15. dxe6 Qxe6 16. Qxb7 Bc5 {Diagram  Black tries to castle. Schwarz versucht zu rochieren.} 17. Nd4 $1 {[%csl Re6,Re7,Re8][%cal Yd4e6,Ye1e8,Ya1e1,Yf1e1] With this excellent move White removes his knight from the e-file and at the same time attacks the black queen with tempo. Mit diesem ausgezeichneten Zug zieht Weiß seinen Springer von der e-Linie und greift gleichzeitig die schwarze Dame an.} Bxd4 (17... Qd7 $16 18. Rfe1+ {(Myers Euwe Yudovich) Kondratiev} Kf8 (18... Kd8 $2 19. Rad1 Bxd4 20. Qb4 $1 $18) 19. Qxd7 Nxd7 20. Nde2 $1 $18 {Myers}) 18. Rae1 O-O ({Black is lost. Also loses Schwarz ist verloren. Es verliert auch} 18... Be5 19. Bxe5 O-O {Myers Euwe Yudovich: ''} (19... Nxe5 20. Rxe5) 20. Bxf6 (20. Bd4 {Myers Euwe Yudovich} Qf5 21. Bxa7 Nf4 22. Qf3 Rc4 23. Re7 $18 {Myers}) 20... Qxf6 21. Qxa7 $18 {Myers Euwe Yudovich: 'Euwe'}) 19. Rxe6 fxe6 20. Bd6 {Myers Euwe Yudovich: '!'} Rfd8 21. Bc7 Rf8 22. Nb5 Be5 (22... Bxb2 {Myers Euwe Yudovich} 23. Nd6 Rxc7 24. Qxc7 Be5 25. g3 Ne4 26. Qc2 $18 {Myers}) 23. Bxe5 Nxe5 24. Qxa7 Nd5 25. Qd4 Ng6 26. h4 Ngf4 27. Qe4 1-0

