{A good example of a sacrifice to go into a won endgame - the pawn sac destorys the pawn structure of the opposing side.} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 e6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 d6 6. g3 a6 7. Bg2 Qc7 8. O-O Be7 9. f4 Nc6 10. Nxc6 bxc6 11. e5 dxe5 12. fxe5 Nd7 13. Bf4 O-O 14. Ne4 $1 {Tal sacs a pawn to go into a won endgame! Incredible! (see variation). Look at what taking the pawn does to black's pawn structure.} Bb7 (14... Nxe5 $2 15. Qd4 f6 16. Bxe5 Qxe5 (16... fxe5 17. Rxf8+ $16) 17. Qxe5 fxe5) 15. Qh5 g6 16. Qe2 c5 17. Nf6+ Bxf6 18. exf6 e5 19. Bxe5 Nxe5 20. Bxb7 Rab8 21. Bd5 Rb6 22. Rae1 Nd7 23. Qe7 c4 24. Kh1 Rxb2 25. Re6 Rbb8 26. Rd6 Rbd8 27. Rd1 1-0

