1. d4 Nc6 2. Nf3 d5 3. c4 Bg4 4. Nc3 e6 5. Bg5 (5. cxd5 exd5 6. Bg5) 5... f6 6. cxd5 exd5 7. Bf4 Bb4 8. Rc1 $6 (8. e3 Nge7 9. h3 Bh5 10. Rc1) 8... Nge7 9. e3 O-O $6 {Weakening} (9... Qd7) (9... g5) 10. h3 Bh5 $2 11. a3 {Now it's not easy to attack Whites weak pawn at c4.} (11. Bd3 Ng6 12. Bh2 (12. Bg3 f5) 12... Nh4 13. g4 Nxf3+ 14. Qxf3 Bg6 15. Bxg6 (15. Qd1 Bxd3 16. Qxd3 f5) 15... hxg6 16. O-O Bxc3 17. Rxc3 Qd7) (11. Be2) 11... Bd6 (11... Bxc3+ 12. Rxc3 Ng6 13. Bh2 (13. Bg3 f5) 13... Nh4 14. g4 Nxf3+ 15. Qxf3 Bg6 16. Qd1) 12. Bxd6 {With the closede center White is ready to attack on the wing.} Qxd6 13. Bd3 (13. Be2 a6 (13... f5 14. O-O f4 15. e4) 14. O-O Nd8 15. Qc2 Ne6) 13... f5 $2 14. Ne2 (14. g3 f4 15. exf4 (15. gxf4 Ng6 16. Bxg6 (16. Be2 Nxf4 17. exf4 Qxf4 18. Nxd5 Qe4 19. Nc3 Qf5 20. O-O Bxf3 21. Bxf3 Qxf3 22. Qxf3 Rxf3) 16... Qxg6) 15... Nxd4 16. Bxh7+ Kh8 17. Qxd4 Bxf3 18. O-O Kxh7 19. Qd3+ Be4 20. Nxe4 dxe4 21. Qxe4+ Nf5 22. g4 Rae8 23. Qb1 Qxf4 (23... Qg6 24. Rxc7) 24. gxf5 c6 25. Rfe1 Rxe1+ 26. Rxe1 Rxf5 27. Qc2 Qg5+ 28. Kf1 Qg6 29. Re3 Rf4 30. Qxg6+ Kxg6) 14... Bxf3 15. gxf3 f4 16. e4 (16. Nxf4 Rxf4 17. exf4 Rf8) 16... dxe4 17. Bxe4 Kh8 18. Rg1 Rad8 19. Qc2 Qh6 (19... Nxd4 20. Nxd4 Qxd4 $13 21. Bxh7 Qf6) 20. Qc5 Qd6 21. Rg5 h6 22. Rh5 Rd7 23. d5 $5 Ne5 24. Qxd6 cxd6 25. Nd4 $1 Ng8 26. Ke2 Re8 27. Rf5 Nf6 28. Ne6 Nf7 29. h4 Kg8 30. Rg1 Nxe4 31. Rxg7+ Kh8 32. Rfxf7 Rxf7 33. Rxf7 Nc5 34. Rf6 h5 35. b4 Na4 36. Rh6+ Kg8 37. Rxh5 Rc8 38. Rg5+ Kf7 $2 39. Nxf4 Rc2+ 40. Kf1 Nc3 41. Rf5+ Kg7 {This move was sealed by Matanovic, but he resigned without resuming.} 42. h5 $1 Nd1 43. Ne6+ Kh6 44. Nd8 Nxf2 45. Nf7+ $1 Kh7 46. Nxd6 Nd1 47. Rf7+ Kh6 48. Ne4 Ne3+ 49. Kg1 {An interesting ending. Is there a winning way for White?} Nxd5 $6 50. Rxb7 Ra2 51. Rb5 Ne3 52. Ra5 Rg2+ 53. Kh1 Rg7 54. Kh2 $18 Nc4 $2 {Tal} 55. Rc5 Nxa3 56. Kh3 Rb7 57. Kg4 Rb6 58. Ra5 Nb5 59. Nc5 $15 Nc7 60. Rxa7 Rxb4+ 61. Ne4 Rc4 62. Ra5 $1 Rc1 $2 63. Re5 Rc4 64. f4 Nd5 65. Rxd5 Rxe4 66. Rd6+ Kg7 67. Kg5 Re7 68. Rc6 $18 Ra7 $6 69. Re6 Rb7 70. h6+ Kh7 71. f5 Ra7 72. Re5 Ra1 73. Re7+ Kg8 $16 74. Rb7 $2 Rc1 $1 75. Kg6 Rg1+ 76. Kf6 Ra1 $18 77. h7+ $1 Kh8 78. Kf7 Ra8 79. Ke7 Re8+ 80. Kd7 Rd8+ $14 81. Ke7 Rf8 82. Rb5 Kxh7 83. Ke6 $1 Kg7 84. Ke7 Rf7+ 85. Ke6 Rf6+ 86. Ke5 Ra6 $13 87. Rb7+ Kf8 88. Rh7 $1 Rb6 $2 89. Rh8+ Kf7 90. Kf4 $1 Ra6 91. Kg5 Rb6 $1 92. Rh7+ Kf8 93. Rd7 $1 Ra6 1-0

