1. e4 c5 2. c3 Nf6 3. e5 Nd5 4. d4 cxd4 5. Qxd4 e6 6. Nf3 Nc6 7. Qe4 d6 8. Nbd2 (8. Bc4) 8... dxe5 9. Nxe5 Nf6 (9... Nxe5 10. Qxe5 Qc7) (9... Bd6) 10. Qa4 (10. Nxc6 Qxd2+ $1) 10... Qd5 (10... Qc7) (10... Bd7 {T}) 11. Ndf3 Bd6 12. Bf4 Qe4+ 13. Qxe4 Nxe4 14. Bd3 (14. Bb5 O-O (14... Bd7 15. Nxd7 Bxf4 16. Nde5) 15. Bxc6 bxc6 $18 {T} 16. Be3) (14. Rd1) 14... Nxe5 15. Bxe5 (15. Nxe5 g5 {T}) 15... Bxe5 16. Nxe5 $146 Nc5 17. Bc2 f6 (17... Nd7 18. Nc4 Ke7 $17 19. O-O-O Nf6 20. Nd6 Rd8 $1 {N}) 18. Nc4 Ke7 19. O-O-O (19. b4 Na6 20. Be4 Rb8 21. Na5) 19... Bd7 20. b4 Na6 21. Nd6 b6 22. Rhe1 {P 23. h4 P e1-e3-h3 T} g6 23. Bb3 (23. f4 {T}) 23... Rad8 (23... Nc7 $1 24. f4 Rhd8 (24... Bc6 25. f5 (25. b5 Rad8) 25... e5)) 24. f4 Nc7 {Najdorf offered a draw. Tal refused.} 25. f5 gxf5 26. Nxf5+ Kf7 (26... Kf8 $1 {N} 27. Bxe6) 27. Rd3 (27. Rd6 $10 {N} Bc8 (27... Ke8 $2) 28. Rc6 {T}) 27... Bc8 28. Rg3 Ne8 29. Nd4 $1 {N} Nc7 30. Nf5 $1 {N} (30. Nc6 Rd6 31. Nxa7 Bd7) 30... Ne8 31. Nd4 $1 {T} Nc7 32. Re4 $1 Rdg8 33. Rxg8 {P 34. c7, 34. f6, h3 +- N} Rxg8 34. Nf5 Rd8 (34... Kf8 35. Rc4) 35. Rg4 Ne8 36. Rh4 h5 37. Rxh5 Kg6 38. Ng3 Ng7 (38... Rd3 39. Bc2 {N}) (38... Nd6 39. Rh4 $1 e5) 39. Rh4 Bb7 40. Rg4+ Kf7 $18 {adjourned} 41. Ne2 f5 (41... Rh8 42. Rc4 Ne8 43. Rd4 Ke7 44. Nf4 $10 {T} Rxh2 45. Bxe6 Nd6 46. Kb2 (46. c4 Bxg2 47. c5 {N} bxc5 48. bxc5 Nb5 49. Rd7+ Ke8 50. Rg7 Bc6 $1 {T}) 46... b5 {T} 47. Rd2) 42. Rc4 Ne8 (42... Rd7 43. Nf4 Kf6 $10 {N} 44. Rd4 Bc6 $1 {T} (44... Rc7 45. Kd2)) (42... Bxg2 43. Nf4 Bf3 44. Rc7+ {T} Kf6 45. Rxg7) 43. Rd4 Rd6 44. Nf4 Bc8 45. Ba4 Rxd4 46. Bxe8+ Kxe8 47. cxd4 Ke7 48. Kd2 Kf6 49. Nd3 Kg5 50. Ke3 Ba6 51. Nf4 Bc4 52. a3 a5 53. g3 Kg4 54. Kf2 Kg5 55. h4+ $18 {N} Kf6 56. Ke3 axb4 57. axb4 $1 {N/T} e5 58. Nd3 {T} exd4+ 59. Kxd4 b5 60. Nf4 $18 {N} Bf1 61. Kd5 Bc4+ 62. Kd6 Bb3 63. Nd5+ {T} Kg6 64. Ke5 Bc2 {T} 65. Ne7+ $1 {N} Kh5 66. Nxf5 1-0

