1. e4 Nf6 2. e5 Nd5 3. d4 d6 4. Nf3 dxe5 5. c4 e4 (5... Nb4 6. Qa4+ N8c6 7. d5) (5... Nf6 6. Nxe5 e6 7. Nc3 c5 8. Be3) (5... Nb6 6. Nxe5 g6 7. Nc3 Bg7 8. Be3 $11 {½-½ Iturrizaga Bonelli,E (2603)-Almeida Quintana,O (2548)/Sabadell 2011/CBM 144 Extra (30)} O-O 9. Qb3) 6. cxd5 exf3 7. Qxf3 c6 (7... g6 $5 8. Nc3 Bg7 9. Bf4) 8. Bc4 cxd5 9. Bxd5 e6 10. Bxb7 Qc7 (10... Bxb7 11. Qxb7 $11 {1-0 Hjartarson,J (2590)-Azmaiparashvili,Z (2540)/Madrid 1988/EXT 1997 (62)} {The position is equal after} Nd7 $5) 11. Bxc8 (11. Bxa8 Qxc1+ 12. Qd1 Qxb2 (12... Bb4+ $6 13. Nc3 Bxc3+ ({White achieves nothing after} 13... Qxb2 $5 14. O-O Bxc3 (14... Qxc3 15. Rc1) 15. Rb1) 14. bxc3 Qxc3+ 15. Kf1 Ba6+ 16. Kg1 O-O 17. h4 $16 {1-0 Wenninger,P (2207)-Drazic,S (2511)/Livigno 2012/CBM 150 Extra (60)}) 13. O-O Qxa1 14. Qb3 $11 {0-1 Panelo Munoz,M (2435)-Lopez Gonzalez,D (2207)/Roquetas de Mar 2011/CBM 140 Extra (36)} (14. Qd2 a5 15. Nc3 Qxf1+ 16. Kxf1 Bb4 $11) {In the event of} 14... Bd6 $5 (14... Qxd4 15. Qxb8 Qd7 16. Rc1 Kd8 {the best for Black is} 17. Qe5 $1) 15. Rd1) 11... Qxc1+ 12. Ke2 Qc4+ (12... Qxh1 13. Qxa8 $44 {Black has good compensation for the pawn:} Bd6 14. Qxa7 {½-½ Mamadshoev,M (2315)-Schlosser,M (2380)/Yerevan 1996/EXT 1997 (34)} {Or} O-O 15. Bb7 Nd7) 13. Kd1 Nc6 (13... Qxd4+ $11 {½-½ Pacheco Asmat,J (2385)-Sokolov,I (2670)/Yerevan 1996/EXT 1997 (48)} {In the event of} 14. Kc1 $5 (14. Nd2 Bb4) 14... Qc5+ 15. Nc3 Nc6 16. Bb7 Nd4) 14. Nd2 Qb5 15. a4 $5 Qb6 16. Bxe6 fxe6 17. Re1 Kd7 (17... O-O-O 18. Rc1 Rd6 19. d5 exd5 20. Re8+ Kb7 21. Nb3 (21. Rxf8 Ne5 22. Qf5 Rxf8 23. Qxf8) 21... Rf6 $2 (21... Rd8 22. Rxc6 Kxc6 23. a5 Qc7 24. Nd4+ Kb7 25. a6+ Kc8 (25... Kxa6 $11 {Also possible is} 26. Qe2+ Kb7 27. Qb5+ Qb6 28. Qxb6+ Kxb6 29. Rxd8) 26. Qh3+ Qd7 $11 27. Qc3+ $5 Bc5 $5 28. Qxc5+ Qc7 29. Qxc7+ Kxc7 30. Ne6+) 22. Qh3 $1 $16 Qc7 23. Rc5 a6 24. Na5+ $1 Kb6 25. Qb3+ Kxc5 $2 26. Nb7+ Qxb7 (26... Kd4 27. Qc3#) 27. Qxb7) 18. d5 exd5 19. Qf5+ Kc7 20. Qf7+ Be7 21. Rxe7+ Nxe7 22. Qxe7+ $11 Kb8 $5 23. Ra3 1-0

