1. d4 {[%mdl 2] 1) Tal in Shakhmatyi v SSSR 1958. Reprinted in 2)Kirillov: Mikhail Tal 1949-1961. Riga. 1996. p.134-138. Tal plays for the first place, winning his first championship of Sovet Union. Spassky plays for a qualifikation place in the Interzonal in Portoroz 1958. The first four are qualified. With a win Spassky will share 3.-4. place with Bronsten. With a draw he will become 4.-6. with Averbakh and Gurgenidze. So Spassky plays 66 moves for a win. After getting a clear winning position after move 55..h5? he first did not realize his advantage and later blundered (67.g3?) with the result of loosing the game and the qualifiaktion for the interzonal.} Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. a3 (4. Bg5) (4. e3) 4... Bxc3+ 5. bxc3 c5 6. e3 Nc6 7. Bd3 e5 (7... O-O 8. Ne2 b6 9. e4 Ne8) 8. Ne2 (8. d5 e4 9. Bc2 (9. dxc6 exd3 10. cxd7+ Qxd7) 9... Ne5) 8... e4 9. Bb1 b6 10. Ng3 Ba6 11. f3 (11. Qa4 Na5 12. Nxe4 {Keres} Nxe4 13. Bxe4 Rc8) (11. Nxe4 Nxe4 12. Bxe4 Bxc4 13. f3 $13) 11... Bxc4 (11... exf3 12. Qxf3 Bxc4 13. Nf5 O-O 14. e4) 12. Nf5 (12. fxe4 d6 13. Qf3 O-O (13... Rc8 $143 14. Nf5 O-O 15. Qg3 Ne8 16. e5) 14. e5 dxe5 15. Qxc6 exd4) 12... O-O (12... d5 13. Nxg7+ Kf8 14. Nf5 Rg8 15. Ng3) 13. Nd6 Bd3 14. Bxd3 exd3 15. Qxd3 cxd4 16. cxd4 Ne8 $1 17. Nf5 d5 18. a4 (18. Qb5 Rc8 19. a4 Nd6 20. Nxd6 (20. Qxd5 Nxf5 21. Qxf5 Nxd4 $19) 20... Qxd6 21. Ba3 Qe6 $17) 18... Nd6 19. Nxd6 (19. Ba3 Nxf5 20. Bxf8 $2 Qg5) 19... Qxd6 20. Ba3 Nb4 21. Qb3 a5 22. O-O Rfc8 23. Rac1 $11 {Draw offer by Tal. That time You offered a draw before you moved. Remisangebot (Tal)} Qe6 24. Bxb4 $6 (24. e4 Qh6 25. Rxc8+ Rxc8 26. Rd1 Qg5 $11) 24... axb4 $15 25. Kf2 Qd6 26. h3 (26. Kg1 Qe6 $11) 26... Kf8 $2 {Tal} (26... h5) 27. Rc2 $1 $11 Rxc2+ 28. Qxc2 g6 29. Rc1 (29. Rb1 Kg7 30. Qb3 Qc6 31. Qxb4 Rxa4 32. Qxb6 Ra2+ 33. Kg3 Qc2 34. Rg1 Qf2+ 35. Kh2 Qxe3) 29... Qd7 30. Qc6 Qxc6 31. Rxc6 Ra6 (31... Rxa4 $142 32. Rxb6 Ke7 $11) 32. a5 b3 33. axb6 (33. Rc3 b2 34. Rb3 bxa5 35. Rxb2 a4 36. Ra2 a3 $11) 33... b2 34. b7 b1=Q 35. Rc8+ Kg7 36. b8=Q Ra2+ 37. Kg3 Qe1+ 38. Kh2 (38. Kf4 Rxg2 $1) 38... Qxe3 39. Rg8+ Kf6 $6 (39... Kh6 $142 40. Qf8+ Kh5 41. Qxf7 Rxg2+ 42. Kxg2 Qd2+ $11) 40. Qd6+ $14 (40. Re8 Qxd4 41. Re2 Rd2 $1 42. Qh8+ Kf5 43. Qc8+ Kg5 44. Qc1 Qf4+ 45. Kh1 Rd4 $1 $17 (45... Rxe2 $2 46. h4+ Kf5 47. g4+ Ke5 48. Qc7+ $18)) 40... Qe6 41. Qf4+ Qf5 42. Qd6+ (42. Qg3 $14) 42... Qe6 $11 43. Qg3 Qe3 44. h4 Re2 $1 (44... Ra1 $143 45. Qd6+ Qe6 46. Qf4+ (46. Qd8+ Qe7 47. Qxd5 Rh1+ $11) 46... Qf5 47. Qh6) 45. Qd6+ Qe6 $11 {[#] In dieser Stellung wurde die Partie vertagt.} 46. Qf4+ {Sealed move.} (46. Qd8+ Qe7 47. Re8 (47. Qxd5 Rxg2+ 48. Kxg2 Qe2+ {Dauerschach}) 47... Qxd8 48. Rxd8 Rd2 49. Rxd5 Ke6 50. Re5+ Kd7 51. Re4 f5 $11) 46... Qf5 (46... Ke7 47. h5 $1 {[%cal Rf4h4]}) 47. Qh6 Ke7 48. Qf8+ Kf6 49. Qg7+ Ke7 50. Ra8 $1 {[%cal Ra8a7]} Qd7 51. Qf8+ Kf6 52. Ra6+ Re6 53. Qh8+ Ke7 54. Ra8 Re1 55. Kg3 {[#]} h5 $1 {RR: ?} (55... Qc7+ 56. Kf2 Qc2+ {?RR} (56... Re6 $145 $11) 57. Kxe1 Qc1+ 58. Kf2 Qd2+ 59. Kg3 Qe1+ 60. Kg4 f5+ 61. Kg5 Qe3+ 62. f4 Qg3+ 63. Kh6 Qxh4+ 64. Kg7 Qf6+ 65. Kxh7 Qh4+ 66. Kg8 $18) 56. Kf2 {RR: +-} Re6 {[#]} 57. Rc8 $16 {Tal:! RR:?} (57. Qb8 $145 $18 Kf6 58. g4 hxg4 59. fxg4 {[#]} Qd6 (59... Re4 60. Qh8+ Ke7 61. Qf8+ Kf6 62. Ra6+ Re6 63. g5+ Kf5 64. Qa3 $18) 60. Qh8+ Ke7 61. Re8+ Kd7 62. Rd8+ $18) 57... Rd6 {RR:?} (57... Qd6 $4 58. Re8+ Kd7 59. Rd8+ $18) (57... Rc6 $2 58. Qf8+ Kf6 59. Rd8 Qc7 60. Qh8+ Ke7 61. Re8+ Kd7 62. Re5 $18) (57... Rb6 $145 $1 58. Qf8+ Kf6 59. g4 $16 Rb2+ 60. Kg3 hxg4 61. fxg4 Rd2) 58. Qf8+ {RR: +-} Kf6 59. Re8 $145 $2 $16 (59. g4 $145 $18) 59... Re6 60. Qh8+ Kf5 61. Qh6 Kf6 (61... Rxe8 $2 62. Qg5+ Ke6 63. Qe5#) (61... Qxe8 $2 62. Qg5#) 62. Qh8+ $11 (62. Rd8 Qc6 63. Qg5+ Kg7 64. Qxd5 (64. Rxd5 $2 f6) 64... Qc2+ (64... Qc3 $1 $19 {Fritz}) 65. Kg3 Qc7+ 66. Kf2 Qf4 $36) (62. Rg8 $1 $16 {Fritz}) 62... Kf5 63. Rd8 (63. Qh6 Kf6 64. Rg8 $16) 63... Qc6 $1 {[%cal Rc6c2]} (63... Qb5 {RR:!} 64. Kg3 Re2 (64... Qa5 $145 $11) 65. Kh3 {[%cal Rg2g4]}) 64. Rc8 $11 (64. Kg3 $11) 64... Qa6 65. Kg3 (65. Qd8 $11) 65... Qd6+ {Now Black has no problems anymore.} 66. Kh3 (66. Kf2 Qf4 (66... Qh2) (66... Qb4 $1 $19 {Fritz})) 66... Re1 {[#]} 67. g3 $2 {Suddenly White is loosing the game.} (67. g4+ {RR: !=} hxg4+ 68. fxg4+ Kf4 69. Qh6+ (69. Rc3 $145 $11) 69... Ke4 $1 70. Re8+ Kf3 $19) 67... Rg1 $17 (67... Qa6 $19 68. g4+ hxg4+ 69. fxg4+ Kf4 70. Qh6+ Kf3 71. Rc3+ Ke4 72. Qd2 $13 Rh1+ {Fritz} 73. Kg3 Qd6+ 74. Kg2 Qh2#) 68. f4 Re1 {[#]} (68... Ke4 $17) 69. Rc2 $2 (69. Re8 $142 Rxe8 70. Qxe8 Qe6 $17) 69... Qe6 $19 70. Rf2 (70. Qc8 Qxc8 71. Rxc8 Re4) 70... Rh1+ 71. Kg2 Qe4+ 72. Rf3 Kg4 73. Qc8+ f5 (73... f5 74. Qc3 Rf1) 0-1

