1. e4 {1) Kirillov: Mikhail Tal. Tvorchestvo 1949-1961. p.34-36.} c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 a6 6. f4 e5 7. Nf3 Nbd7 8. Bd3 (8. a4 Be7 9. Bd3 O-O 10. O-O exf4 11. Bxf4 Qb6+ 12. Kh1 Qxb2 13. Qe1 Qb6 14. Bg5 Nc5 15. Qh4 Nxd3 16. cxd3 Qd8 $5 {[%cal Gd8f6,Gh7h6] Rizzitano}) 8... Be7 (8... b5) 9. O-O O-O 10. Kh1 b5 11. a3 Qc7 12. fxe5 dxe5 13. Nh4 Nc5 14. Bg5 Qd8 $146 ({RR} 14... h6 15. Bc1 Be6 16. Nf5 Rfd8 17. Nxe7+ Qxe7 18. Qf3 Ncd7 19. Bd2 Re8 20. h3 Kh7 21. Ne2 Qd6 22. Ng3 g6 23. Rf2 Kg7 24. Raf1 Rac8 25. Qe3 Rh8 26. Ne2 h5 27. Bc3 Bc4 28. Bxc4 Rxc4 29. Qg5 {Szymanski,A-Gadalinski,J/Krakow 1953/EXT 2002/1-0 (56)}) (14... Be6 {With transposition of moves, in the game happened 13...Bd8.} 15. Nf5 Bd8 16. Qe1 Nh5 17. Qh4 Nf4 $13 {with a hard fight. 1-0 (26) Ravinsky,G-Ilivitzki,G Riga (Latvia) 1952 EXT 2003 [GJ17Datum]}) 15. Nf5 $36 {[%csl Re7,Gf5,Rg7]} Bxf5 16. Rxf5 Nfd7 (16... g6 17. Rf1 Nxd3 $132) 17. Bxe7 Qxe7 18. Nd5 $36 {[%csl Gd5]} Qd6 19. Qg4 $1 {[%csl Rg7][%cal Ga1f1]} g6 (19... f6 20. Rh5 {[%cal Yd5e3,Ye3f5]}) 20. Raf1 f6 {[#]} 21. h4 $6 (21. R1f3 $142 $1 {[%cal Gf3h3] Tal missed this possibility in the game and in his notes.} Kh8 22. Rh3 $1 Rg8 23. Qh4 Rg7 24. Nxf6 $1 Nxf6 25. Rxf6 {[%csl Rd6][%cal Gf6g6,Gf6d6]} Qe7 {[%cal Ge7h4]} 26. Qf2 $16) 21... Kh8 22. R5f3 $2 (22. R5f2 f5 23. Qe2 Rad8 $15) 22... f5 $19 23. exf5 $1 Qxd5 24. fxg6 Rxf3 {[#]} 25. g7+ $2 (25. Rxf3 e4 (25... Rg8 $142 $1 26. Qh5 Rg7 $17 {Tal}) 26. Rf5 Qe6 27. g7+ Kg8 28. Be2 $13) 25... Kg8 26. Bxh7+ {Typique du style du futur Champion du Monde qui aimait pêcher en eaux troubles mais le sacrifice est incorrect sur une défense précise des Noirs mais devant l'Echiquier, c'est une autre histoire...} (26. Rxf3 e4 27. Rf5 Qe6 $19 {Tal}) 26... Kxh7 27. Rxf3 Ne4 $19 (27... Qe6 28. Qh5+ Qh6 29. Qf7 {[%cal Gf7h7,Gg7g8]} Qxg7 $19) 28. h5 Ndf6 29. Qg6+ Kg8 30. h6 {[%csl Gg7,Gh6] [#]} Ra7 $19 (30... Nh7 31. Rf8+ Nxf8 32. gxf8=Q+ Kxf8 33. Qg7+ Ke8 34. h7 Qd1+ $11 {Tal}) (30... Rd8 $19) (30... Rc8 $19) 31. Kh2 {[#]} Re7 $2 (31... Rf7 32. Rh3 Nh7 33. Rd3 Qa8 34. Qb6 $18 {Tal}) (31... Qd2 $1 {[%mdl 64]} 32. h7+ (32. Rh3 Qf4+ 33. Kg1 Ng5 $19) 32... Nxh7 33. Qxe4 Qh6+ 34. Rh3 Nf6 $1 {[%cal Gf6e4] la pointe!} 35. Rxh6 (35. Qxe5 Ng4+) 35... Nxe4 $19) 32. Rh3 $18 {[%cal Gh6h7]} Nh7 33. Rd3 Qa8 34. Qxe4 Qxe4 35. Rd8+ Kf7 36. g8=Q+ Kf6 37. Rd6+ Kf5 38. Qg6+ Kf4 39. g3+ Ke3 40. Rd3+ Qxd3 41. Qxd3+ Kf2 1-0

